<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   558.0   vs 1,476.0</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   674.0   vs   837.0</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     686.0   vs 1,635.0</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    686.0   vs   756.0</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		  1.80   vs 1.98 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales			     20,863.0   vs 19,900.0</p>
<p>    Dividend				     0.50    vs 0.50 marks</p>
<p>    No of employees			   57,999   vs 57,586</p>
<p>    Personnel costs			   5,756.0  vs 5,400.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German airline group is Deutsche Lufthansa AG. Lufthansa said that in the previous year, the pre-tax figure included extraordinary income totalling 879 million marks from the release of special items with an equity portion which individual group companies had accumulated up to the end of 1994.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
